      { "label": "glue", "text": "." }
    ],
    "proof_cite": null
  },
  {
    "role": "deduction",
    "text": "Thus, the base $DC$ is equal to the base $AB$,",
    "assertion": "base DC equals base AB",
    "spans": [
      { "label": "glue", "text": "Thus, the " },
      { "label": "assertion", "text": "base $DC$ is equal to the base $AB$" },
      { "label": "glue", "text": "," }
    ],
    "proof_cite": null
  },
  {
    "role": "deduction",
    "text": "and the triangle $DBC$ will be equal to the triangle $ACB$ [Prop.~1.4],",
    "assertion": "triangle DBC equals (in area) triangle ACB",
    "spans": [
      { "label": "glue", "text": "and the " },
      { "label": "assertion", "text": "triangle $DBC$ will be equal to the triangle $ACB$" },
      { "label": "glue", "text": " [Prop.~1.4]," }
    ],
    "proof_cite": "1.4"
  },
  {
    "role": "deduction",
    "text": "the lesser to the greater.",
    "assertion": "the lesser (triangle DBC) is equated to the greater (triangle ACB)",
    "spans": [
      { "label": "assertion", "text": "the lesser to the greater" },
      { "label": "glue", "text": "." }
    ],
    "proof_cite": null
  },
  {
    "role": "deduction",
    "text": "The very notion (is) absurd [C.N.~5].",
    "assertion": "contradiction",
    "frame": { "kind": "contradiction" },
    "spans": [
      { "label": "assertion", "text": "The very notion (is) absurd" },
      { "label": "glue", "text": " [C.N.~5]." }
    ],
    "proof_cite": null
  },
  {
    "role": "deduction",
    "text": "Thus, $AB$ is not unequal to $AC$.",
    "assertion": "AB is not unequal to AC",
    "frame": { "kind": "reductio_close", "closes": "$AB$ is unequal to $AC$" },
    "spans": [
      { "label": "glue", "text": "Thus, " },
      { "label": "assertion", "text": "$AB$ is not unequal to $AC$" },
      { "label": "glue", "text": "." }
    ],
    "proof_cite": null
  },
  {
    "role": "deduction",
    "text": "Thus, (it is) equal. ",
    "assertion": "AB is equal to AC",
    "spans": [
      { "label": "glue", "text": "Thus, (it is) " },
      { "label": "assertion", "text": "equal" },
      { "label": "glue", "text": ". " }
    ],
    "proof_cite": null
  },
  {
    "role": "conclusion",
    "text": "Thus, if a triangle has two angles equal to one another then the sides subtending the equal angles will also be equal to one another. (Which is) the very thing it was required to show."
  }
]

